{
  "schema": "mef-offline-evidence-runs-v1",
  "execution_policy": "Only these read-only research scripts; no target, original Lua, or Server execution. JSON verifier stdout is compared with saved receipts; the pinned text fixture runner must exit zero and leave its recomputed fixture receipt equal to the saved version.",
